	Environment registration adapted from RoboLab. src/amp/robots/robolab/registration.py is an
	adaptation of auto_register_droid_envs in
	robolab/registrations/droid/auto_env_registrations_jointpos.py, RoboLab v0.3.1
	(https://github.com/NVlabs/RoboLab, commit 9db0aaf09d9fe5d4f37b168320788258c7012463).
	Changes made by AMP: the registration is the same except that it enables depth on the two
	over-shoulder cameras through RoboLab's own with_depth helper and adds one wrist-camera depth
	observation term. The file is marked as changed in its header, which also carries NVIDIA's
	copyright line and the SPDX Apache-2.0 identifier. RoboLab itself is not part of this
	repository; the user clones it.

	Camera values from RoboLab. src/amp/geometry/robolab_cameras.py restates, as numbers, the poses
	and intrinsics of RoboLab v0.3.1's DROID cameras: EgocentricMirroredWideAngleCameraCfg,
	OverShoulderLeftCameraCfg and OverShoulderRightCameraCfg in robolab/variations/camera.py, and
	_WRIST_CAM in robolab/robots/droid.py. The file carries NVIDIA's copyright line and the SPDX
	Apache-2.0 identifier, and is marked as changed in its header; src/amp/geometry/cameras.py
	imports it and holds no RoboLab code.

	Robot geometry data from RoboLab. src/amp/geometry/assets/droid_robot.tlf,
	src/amp/geometry/assets/robot_spheres.json and the project page's docs/assets/task-flow/robot.js
	are adapted from RoboLab v0.3.1's assets/robots/franka_robotiq_2f_85_flattened.usd and are
	licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, not under the Apache License below;
